'' 'dim x as CONST T = ( 1 )' is a field list like the unqualified form; the const qualifier
'' made tiko store the integer over the UDT and decline (fbc's overload/byval-as-const.bas). Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/const-udt-paren-init.bas -o tests/codegen/constudtpareninit.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/constudtpareninit.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1              2              1             2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5
